      "text": "Liyang Network Teach-In\nThursday, March 5th, 7-9PM\nLiyang Oakland is a community-based solidarity chapter in Oakland, CA amplifying the calls to action of Lumad (indigenous) communities in Mindanao, Philippines.\nThey will be answering questions like: Who are the Lumad? Who are the Alamara? Why are the Lumad in sanctuary? What is the Philippine or US government doing about the attacks?\nLearn more here\nFollow on Instagram @liyang.oakland",
      "html": "<h1 class=\"font_0 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:31px;\"><span style=\"font-size:31px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Liyang Network Teach-In</span></h1>\n\n<h1 class=\"font_0 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:24px;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Thursday, March 5th, 7-9PM</span></h1>\n\n<h1 class=\"font_0 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:15px;\">Liyang Oakland is a community-based solidarity chapter in Oakland, CA amplifying&nbsp;the calls to action of Lumad (indigenous) communities in Mindanao, Philippines.</h1>\n\n<h1 class=\"font_0 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:15px;\">They will be answering questions like: Who are the Lumad? Who are the Alamara? Why are the Lumad in sanctuary? What&nbsp;is the Philippine or US government doing about the attacks?</h1>\n\n<h1 class=\"font_0 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:15px;\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><a href=\"https://www.liyangnetwork.org/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Learn more here</a></span></h1>\n\n<h1 class=\"font_0 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:15px;\">Follow on Instagram <span style=\"text-decoration:underline;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/liyang.oakland/?hl=en\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">@liyang.oakland</a></span></h1>",
